nce metrics into consideration. It has been inferred that all the three parallel architectures have higher performance when compared with the existing classification systems. Also, our IELU performs better than the widely used activation functions in text classification application.","topics":[],"score":235153,"global_rank":96193,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":18199},{"name":"madhuroopa/linkedin-learning-airflow-course","owner":"madhuroopa","html_url":"https://github.com/madhuroopa/linkedin-learning-airflow-course","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"hands-on-apache-airflow-with-linkedin-learning","topics":[],"score":235148,"global_rank":96206,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":18200}]